@ The public interface is that of the Windows renderer with two changes. There is no
|Resize| and no |Present|: the view that shows the window (\S\ref{macmain}) takes care of
its own drawables. And there is |BeginFrame|, which starts the command buffer of the
frame. The scene comes back as a texture, which ImGui can draw directly.

